      "fork_date": "1790732851 +0000",
      "fork_message": "Make installed ATen CMake include paths relocatable\n\nATenConfig substituted the wheel's temporary installation prefix, leaving\nnative consumers with a nonexistent include directory and embedding a new\nstaging path on repeated builds. Compute the include path relative to the\ninstalled CMake package and preserve that variable until the consumer reads\nit. Keep the correction in owned source rather than modifying wheel output.\n\nTest Plan:\n```bash\nexport PATH=/work/venv/bin:$PATH\n/work/venv/bin/python -m pytest -p no:cacheprovider -q /src/tests/test_v100_framework_patch.py\nexport PATH=/work/lint-venv/bin:$PATH UV_CACHE_DIR=/work/lint-cache/uv UV_PYTHON_INSTALL_DIR=/work/lint-python UV_OFFLINE=1\ncd /work/sources/pytorch\nspin quicklint -- -a aten/src/ATen/CMakeLists.txt aten/src/ATen/ATenConfig.cmake.in\n```\n\nPrepared with an AI assistant. No upstream publication.\n",
      "owned_patches": [
        {
          "artifact": "0001-relocatable-aten-config.patch",
          "bytes": 1315,
          "sha256": "526cd86602bf48fc60d8a162069de700d3e01b796de34296b9265e4d3ce074dc"
        }
